      'Embedding coordinates structured text qaac notation masaale., `|__geo:lat,lng` waxaa ay qaadi geospatial xog iyo parse waxyeeli schema migration oo current transaction table.',
      'GDPR Articles 5(1)(c) iyo 13 ay qaadi adag obligation meesha xog retail: xog minimization (capture coordinates point-of-sale kaliya, inaan continuously) iyo transparency (qor staff kahor capture bilaab).',
      'Heat maps iyo territory analysis geotag transaction xog ay soo buuliyaa dakhli distribution pattern kuwan time-series xog midbaad ay waxyeeli karaan.',
